  message: "Reopened (real-repro validation 2026-07-18, VernissageServer=~/ALL_REPOS/repos_Apr12_2026/VernissageServer): Swift funnels wide open. 302 create/delete/run calls resolve @0.85 (ast_call) to internal defs; 188 suppressed; 0 legit. Magnet: delete<-99 src files->ActivityPubClient.delete, create<-73, run<-61. Ground truth: AccountController.boot:86 `.delete(\"refresh-token\",\":username\",use:revoke)` = Vapor route registration, misbound to ActivityPubClient.delete (HTTP client). Every Vapor controller boot does this. Cause: gate only extracts function-param receiver types; misses route-builder chains / locals / fields. Design pending 3-lens investigation."  # a0e5
