  message: "Swift facet DONE (PR merged c3e258b03d). Real-repro VernissageServer: create/delete/run magnet ELIMINATED — 302 -> 0 high-confidence cross-type misbinds (delete<-99 files->ActivityPubClient.delete, create<-73, run<-61 now honest external); 23 genuine inherited implicit-self calls recovered via inherited_calls Site-1. Fix wires Swifts resolver path to the shared defer_bare_method_call helper (extracted to analyze/base.py, Scala refactored onto it too, docspell still 242->0). Residual 7 funnel.py hits = 3 legit typed-receiver resolutions (let c=ActivityPubClient(); c.create() -> ActivityPubClient.create, verified in source) + 4 sub-0.5-threshold edges — NOT magnet misbinds. Swift local_symbols keyed by full name so only the resolver path needs gating. 10271 tests green, 100% cov. INV-fahub stays violated (D WI-situj + fleet-wide rollout remain)."  # df86
